* Fresh-state circuit IV; zero-L symmetric SQUID with fixed Phi_ext=0.25 Phi0.
* This sweeps the complete circuit, unlike the junction-model .iv command.
.param BIAS=@VALUE@
.option seed=123
I1 0 N DC BIAS
B1 N 0 JM1
B2 N 0 JM2
.model JM1 JJ(RTYPE=0 ICRIT=100u RN=16 CAP=0 PHI=0.7853981633974483)
.model JM2 JJ(RTYPE=0 ICRIT=100u RN=16 CAP=0 PHI=-0.7853981633974483)
.tran .01p 1n DST
.print V(N)
.end
